          "description": "ABC Kids listen is a dedicated 24/7 radio station made for kids, brought to you by the Australian Broadcasting Corporation. With music to move, podcasts to inspire, and stories and soundtracks for sleep, ABC Kids listen stimulates curiosity, fires imaginations and allows kids to indulge in screen-free listening. The program schedule is designed to mirror the ebb and flow of a child’s day and be the perfect companion for playful days and peaceful nights.\n",
